<body>
<h1 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 16.1px 0.0px; text-align: center; -webkit-hyphens: auto; font: 24.0px Times; color: #fcfcfc; -webkit-text-stroke: #fcfcfc"><span class="s1"><b>Sample Document</b></span></h1>
<h1 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 16.1px 0.0px; -webkit-hyphens: auto; font: 24.0px Times; color: #fcfcfc; -webkit-text-stroke: #fcfcfc"><span class="s1"><b>Lorem Ipsum Overview</b></span></h1>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <i>consectetur</i> adipiscing elit, sed do <b>eiusmod</b> tempor incididunt ut labore et </span><span class="s2">dolore_magna</span><span class="s1"> aliqua. See the <a href="https://example.com/docs"><span class="s3">example site</span></a> for more.</span></p>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; -webkit-hyphens: auto; font: 18.0px Times; color: #fcfcfc; -webkit-text-stroke: #fcfcfc"><span class="s1"><b>Lists and Structure</b></span></h2>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1">Ut enim ad minim veniam:</span></p>
<ul class="ul1">
  <li class="li5"><span class="s4"></span><span class="s1">First bullet item</span></li>
  <li class="li5"><span class="s4"></span><span class="s1">Second bullet item</span></li>
  <ul class="ul2">
    <li class="li5"><span class="s4"></span><span class="s1">Nested alpha</span></li>
    <li class="li5"><span class="s4"></span><span class="s1">Nested beta</span></li>
  </ul>
  <li class="li5"><span class="s4"></span><span class="s1">Third bullet with </span><span class="s5">struck</span><span class="s1"> text</span></li>
</ul>
<ol class="ol1">
  <li class="li5"><span class="s4"></span><span class="s1">Step one</span></li>
  <li class="li5"><span class="s4"></span><span class="s1">Step two</span></li>
  <li class="li5"><span class="s4"></span><span class="s1">Step three</span></li>
</ol>
<p class="p5"><span class="s1">Term One</span></p>
<p class="p5"><span class="s1">Definition of the first term.</span></p>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; -webkit-hyphens: auto; font: 18.0px Times; color: #fcfcfc; -webkit-text-stroke: #fcfcfc"><span class="s1"><b>Table Section</b></span></h2>
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td1">
        <p class="p5"><span class="s1"><b>Name</b></span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td2">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1"><b>Quantity</b></span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td3">
        <p class="p7"><span class="s1"><b>Price</b></span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td4">
        <p class="p5"><span class="s1">Apple</span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td5">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">3</span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td6">
        <p class="p7"><span class="s1">1.25</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td4">
        <p class="p5"><span class="s1">Banana</span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td5">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">12</span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td6">
        <p class="p7"><span class="s1">0.50</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td4">
        <p class="p5"><span class="s1">Cherry</span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td5">
        <p class="p6"><span class="s1">100</span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td6">
        <p class="p7"><span class="s1">9.99</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; -webkit-hyphens: auto; font: 18.0px Times; color: #fcfcfc; -webkit-text-stroke: #fcfcfc"><span class="s1"><b>Code and Quotes</b></span></h2>
<p class="p8"><span class="s6"><b>def</b></span><span class="s1"> greet(name):</span></p>
<p class="p8"><span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space">Â  Â  </span></span><span class="s6"><b>return</b></span><span class="s1"> </span><span class="s7">"Hello, "</span><span class="s1"> </span><span class="s8">+</span><span class="s1"> name</span></p>
<blockquote style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 12.0px 0.0px; -webkit-hyphens: auto; font: 12.0px Times; color: #a7a7a7; -webkit-text-stroke: #a7a7a7"><span class="s1">Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur.</span></blockquote>
<h3 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.0px 0.0px; -webkit-hyphens: auto; font: 14.0px Times; color: #fcfcfc; -webkit-text-stroke: #fcfcfc"><span class="s1"><b>Unicode Corner</b></span></h3>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1">Accents: cafÃ©, naÃ¯ve, Ã†rÃ¸skÃ¸bing. Greek: Î±Î²Î³Î´. Chinese: æ±‰å­—æµ‹è¯•. Hebrew: ×©×œ×•× ×¢×•×œ×. Arabic: Ù…Ø±Ø­Ø¨Ø§ Ø¨Ø§Ù„Ø¹Ø§Ù„Ù…. Emoji: ğŸ™‚ğŸš€.</span></p>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1">Footnote reference here.</span><span class="s9"><sup>1</sup></span><span class="s1"> Superscript x</span><span class="s10"><sup>2</sup></span><span class="s1"> and subscript H</span><span class="s10"><sub>2</sub></span><span class="s1">O.</span></p>
<p class="p5"><span class="s1"><img src="file:///Attachment.png" alt="Attachment.png"></span></p>
<p class="p5"><span class="s1">Tiny pixel</span></p>
<p class="p11"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
<p class="p3"><span class="s1">Final paragraph with a <a href="https://example.org/page"><span class="s3">second link</span></a> and an autolink <a href="https://example.net/"><span class="s3">https://example.net/</span></a>.</span></p>
<p class="p11"><span class="s1"></span><br></p>
